      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Unity makes VRChat very accessible for creators - and hackers. The worlds are saved & cached on... our hard drives, ready to be loaded into VRChat or Unity itself. I'm not really sure there's much VRChat can do. Even big-budget video games aren't able to protect their assets from getting ripped.\nVRChat could surely put more effort into preventing ripping, which... the rippers would eventually circumvent. I'd prefer it if VRChat's time was spent developing new features and getting itself out of early access.\nIn the meantime, we can do our best to report re-uploaded content when we see it.\nRelated canny:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/protect-your-creators-from-ripper-websites",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
