      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have an idea that I will be posting as a rough suggestion. \nPeople might dislike it but I will talk about why and how in it.\nAnd where to start when we want to stop theft. I believe that my Idea could work.",
      "viewerReactions": null
