  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-14T15:11:55.598Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As of right now. Anyone can easily steal Worlds and Avatar with the press of a button. \nIt's scary and sucks. I don't know where else to post this but, instead of fancy UI updates. I'd much rather see more safety for Content Creators.\nAll it takes is you to join a world with a malicious person in and all of your stuff has been sent to their DataBase.\nSurely it should be possible to secure and protect Content better or at least give an explanation as to why this has not been made a high priority issue.  I want to explore worlds and meet people without having to fear all my hard work  to be stolen by the click of a button.",
